error[E0445]: a constant can only use pure code
   --> tests/programs/m147/impure_show.la:12:35
   |
12 | const LABEL: string = "origin is {Point { x: 0, y: 0 }}";
   |                                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: `Point.show` calls `println`, which prints; a constant is computed before `main` and may not print, read or write files, use the operating system, call C, or start tasks, channels or actors: compute the value in `main` instead

For more about E0445, run `lughac explain E0445`.
